### 商品列表：启动后可用来检查接口连通性
POST http://localhost:8081/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json

{"pageNo":1,"pageSize":12}

### 根据分类查询商品，支持价格排序
POST http://localhost:8081/api/products/by-category
Content-Type: application/json

{"categoryId":1,"pageNo":1,"pageSize":12,"sortBy":"price","asc":true}

### 商品详情
GET http://localhost:8081/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### 注册验证码
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/sms
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone":"13800000000","purpose":"REGISTER"}

### 买家注册：填写收到的验证码
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"your_username","password":"replace_with_8_or_more_chars","phone":"13800000000","code":"123456"}

### 密码登录：成功响应包含 token、refreshToken、userId、sessionId
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone":"13800000000","password":"replace_with_8_or_more_chars"}

### 微信快捷登录：code 必须由真实微信小程序 wx.login 获取
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/wechat
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"wx_login_temporary_code"}

### 管理员登录：需先配置角色与管理员账号
POST http://localhost:8082/api/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone":"13800000000","password":"your_admin_password"}
